     A*
     A* Scandirect Bill File - Detail Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 07/21/05 by c:79 for Project 129MJR
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will house the 'detail info' record for
     A*          the associated Scandirect records. It will be tied to
     A*          FAW1P via W1TRID = W2TRID.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PW201                     TEXT('Scandir Pmt File - Det Info')
     A            W2TYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Record Type')
     A            W2TRID    R               REFFLD(DS15)
     A                                      COLHDG('Control Number')
     A            W2SVDT    R               REFFLD(DT8)
     A                                      COLHDG('Date of Service')
     A            W2RVCD    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      COLHDG('Revenue Code')
     A            W2CODE    R               REFFLD(DS8)
     A                                      COLHDG('Code')
     A            W2CDSC    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A                                      COLHDG('Code Description')
     A            W2PSGP         3S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('PAS Group')
     A            W2UNTS    R     S         REFFLD(A70)
     A                                      COLHDG('Units')
     A            W2MOD     R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      COLHDG('Modifier')
     A            W2POS     R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Place of Service')
     A            W2CHRG        11A
     A                                      COLHDG('Charged')
     A            W2NDC         18A         COLHDG('NDC Drug Code')
     A            W2RX#         13A         COLHDG('Prescription #')
     A            W2DXR     R               REFFLD(DS4)
     A                                      COLHDG('ICD9 x-ref')
     A            W2PAD1       256A         COLHDG('Filler')
     A            W2PAD2       256A         COLHDG('Filler')
     A            W2PAD3       162A         COLHDG('Filler')
     A            W2EOB#    R               REFFLD(EOB#)
     A                                      COLHDG('(PDS) EOMB#')
     A            W2DSEQ    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('(PDS) Detail' +
     A                                      'Sequence #')
     A            W2PRFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Flag')
